<title>CHINA: China Jan-June fuel oil output down 15.1 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June fuel oil output down 15.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 9.51 million tonnes of fuel oil in the first six months, down 15.1 percent compared with the year-ago period, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 1.51 million tonnes of fuel oil in June alone, the report said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
